Auto-bandage oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-06. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the auto-bandage probes run the mode headless and frame by frame: the services, counter, overhead and event pump of
HandleAutoBandage move into RunAutoBandageFrame and its end request into EndAutoBandageFrame, both called where the code
was; with gOracleAutoBandageHeadless set, AutoBandage and SetUpAutoBandageUpdatePanel skip HandleTacticalUI, the mouse
mask and the faces. Appended accessors read and set the file statics of Auto_Bandage.cc (the seconds, the complete, end
and beginning flags, the two lists), the function static soldier_for_full_check of CanAutoBandage (moved to file scope),
the AI slot cursors and the away slots of Overhead.cc, and expose the static FindBestPatient. Timer_Control reads the time
through TimerControlNow, which returns a virtual steady clock instead of ReferenceClock::now() once the oracle switches it
on and advances it. No behaviour change while the switch and the virtual clock are off. Applied by
tools/oracle/build.sh after 0029.

